    {
      "code": "MATH-Q0001",
      "subjectCode": "math",
      "chapterCode": "MATH-01",
      "pointCodes": [
        "MATH-01-01"
      ],
      "type": "SINGLE_CHOICE",
      "difficulty": 1,
      "year": null,
      "source": "ORIGINAL_SEED",
      "stem": "极限 lim(x→0) sin(3x)/x 的值为（　）",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "content": "0"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "content": "1"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "content": "3"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "content": "不存在"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "令 t = 3x，则 x→0 时 t→0，且 x = t/3。于是原式 = lim(t→0) sin t / (t/3) = 3·lim(t→0) sin t / t = 3×1 = 3。这里用到第一个重要极限 lim(t→0) sin t / t = 1。最高频的错误是选 B——分子是 sin(3x) 而不是 sin x，凑出来的系数 3 不能丢。",
      "keywords": [
        "重要极限",
        "等价无穷小",
        "变量代换"
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "MATH-Q0002",
      "subjectCode": "math",
      "chapterCode": "MATH-01",
      "pointCodes": [
        "MATH-01-01"
      ],
      "type": "SINGLE_CHOICE",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "year": null,
      "source": "ORIGINAL_SEED",
      "stem": "极限 lim(x→∞) (1 + 2/x)^x 的值为（　）",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "content": "e"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "content": "e^2"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "content": "2e"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "content": "1"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "令 t = x/2，则 2/x = 1/t，x = 2t，且 x→∞ 时 t→∞。原式 = lim(t→∞)[(1+1/t)^t]^2 = e^2。这是第二个重要极限 lim(t→∞)(1+1/t)^t = e 的标准变形，核心是把指数凑成与括号内的倒数同形。",
      "keywords": [
        "重要极限",
        "1的无穷次方型"
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "MATH-Q0003",
