      "type": "SINGLE_CHOICE",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "year": null,
      "source": "ORIGINAL_SEED",
      "stem": "函数 f(x) = x^3 − 3x^2 − 9x + 5 的单调递减区间是（　）",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "content": "(-∞, -1)"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "content": "(-1, 3)"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "content": "(3, +∞)"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "content": "(-∞, +∞)"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "求导：f'(x) = 3x² − 6x − 9 = 3(x² − 2x − 3) = 3(x−3)(x+1)。令 f'(x) < 0，即 (x−3)(x+1) < 0，解得 −1 < x < 3，故递减区间为 (−1, 3)。顺带可得：递增区间为 (−∞,−1) 与 (3,+∞)；极大值 f(−1) = 10，极小值 f(3) = −22。",
      "keywords": []
    },
